      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols except
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: '- 3 or more Scatters on all reels triggers <style=coinColor>Secret Vault
      Free Games</style>.

      - 3 Scatters - 5 Free Games

      - 4 Scatters - 10 Free Games

      - 5 Scatters - 15 Free Games'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_1
    value: DENOMINATION
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Raise your Total Bet and unlock Jackpots:

      - Denomination 1: Only Mini Jackpot is available.

      - Denomination 2: Only Mini and Minor Jackpots are available.

      - Denomination 3: Mini, Minor and Grand Jackpots are available.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_2
    value: MATCHING CODE FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- Each Vault has its own password to complete to trigger <style=coinColor>Wheel
      Bonus</style>.\n        - Mini Vault consists of 3-digit password in Green.\n
      \       - Minor Vault consists of 4-digit password in Blue.\n        - Grand
      Vault consists of 5-digit password in Red.\n        - One digit is visible at
      a time.\n- Any symbol may appear with a Sub-Symbol with a random digit in one
      of \n  the random three colors: Green, Blue or Red.\n- Player has to collect
      Sub-Symbols with matching color and digit to \n  complete the password for each
      Vault.\n- It is possible to trigger more than one <style=coinColor>Wheel bonus</style>
      per spin.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_3
    value: WHEEL BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Depending on the Vault types, different Wheel Bonus is triggered.\n-
      Wheel has the following wedges:\n        - <style=coinColor>Coin Prize</style>\n
      \       - <style=coinColor>Coin Prize and Spin Again</style>\n        - <style=coinColor>Jackpot
      Wedge</style>\n                - Player can win Mini, Minor, Grand or Grand
      X2 Jackpot depending on\n                  triggering Wheel type, Denomination
      and the Upgrade Wedge\n                  winning status.\n        - <style=coinColor>Upgrade
      Wedge</style>\n                - Once Player wins Upgrade Wedge, it upgrades
      current Wheel type to\n                   the next available one.\n                -
      It may upgrade current Jackpot to the next available one, depending\n                   on
      the denomination."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_TITLE_4
    value: SECRET VAULT FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- 3 or more Scatters triggers Secret Vault Free Games.\n- There is a Special
      Sub-symbol in Purple color that appears on reel 5 for \n  Passwords of Vaults.\n-
      If the number on a Special Sub-Symbol and the password digit of a Vault \n  are
      matching, then it counts as the digit the player has to collect, \n  regardless
      of the color."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32><style=coinColor>Sunset Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=24>At least one             on each of the\nfirst 3 or more consecutive
      reels\ntriggers Sunset Free Games.\n\nEach triggering             reveals\nthe
      number of spins for Free Games.\n\nDuring Free Games,             appears\nmore
      often to increase your chance \nto win <style=coinColor>Lion Jackpot</style>!\n\nNo
      re-trigger allowed."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32><style=coinColor>Upgrade Feature
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=24>5 of a kind with any symbol triggers <style=coinColor>upgrade
      feature</style>.


      Once win is evaluated, all symbols

      of 5 of a kind excluding Wild

      are upgraded into random symbol with equal or higher pay and pay

      is evaluated again.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32><style=coinColor>Lion Jackpot
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>A full screen of upgraded              \nawards <style=coinColor>Lion
      Jackpot</style>!\n\nJackpot can be paid once even if full\nscreen of <style=coinColor>Lions</style>
      pays twice."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=32><style=coinColor>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=32><style=coinColor>LINES
  - key: WHEEL_SEGMENT_VALUE
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: WHEEL_RESPIN_SEGMENT_VALUE
    value: "{0:SimpleNumber} \n+RESPIN"
